: 2, "type": "PreviewImage", "pos": [0, 1030], "size": [900, 560], "flags": {}, "order": 3, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"localized_name": "images", "name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 1}], "outputs": [{"localized_name": "images", "name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "links": null}], "title": "Canvas overview (pins and labels)", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}}, {"id": 3, "type": "MarkdownNote", "pos": [-460, -330], "size": [400, 290], "flags": {}, "order": 1, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "title": "How to use", "properties": {}, "widgets_values": ["## Geekatplay Canvas - Nano Banana 2.1 (Google Gemini, partner API)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1.\n5. Pick aspect ratio and size in the canvas toolbar, then Run.\n\nThe **Prompt** button in the canvas shows the exact text sent to the model.\n\nNeeds a Comfy account with credits. Sends the layout plus up to 7 references. Aspect ratio \"auto\" follows the first image, which is the canvas layout."], "widgets_values_named": {"text": "## Geekatplay Canvas - Nano Banana 2.1 (Google Gemini, partner API)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1.\n5. Pick aspect ratio and size in the canvas toolbar, then Run.\n\nThe **Prompt** button in the canvas shows the exact text sent to the model.\